DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42493::$$$message_0338_0000_0000$$$::"Welcome.[lr]::
42494::$$$message_0338_0000_0001$$$::You've done well to reach this place, Rin."::
42495::$$$message_0338_0000_0002$$$::"Ugh. [wait canskip=0 time=400][l][say storage=HRIN6_RIN_0020 _name=凛]And now Kirei's here, of all people..."::
42496::$$$message_0338_0000_0003$$$::"I have unfortunate news for you.[lr]::
42497::$$$message_0338_0000_0004$$$::This onsen's special trait has only one use left."::
42498::$$$message_0338_0000_0005$$$::"...Huh? Why do you know about it? You're from the Church."::
42499::$$$message_0338_0000_0006$$$::"Hm. What do you mean by that, Rin?"::
42500::$$$message_0338_0000_0007$$$::"What do [font italic=true]you[font italic=false] mean, what do I mean[line len=2][wait canskip=0 time=400][l][hffacechg chara=凛 face=楽 time=200][say storage=HRIN6_RIN_0060 _name=凛]Hey, Archer. Why are you smiling?"::
42501::$$$message_0338_0000_0008$$$::"You still haven't realized that he sent the letter."::
42502::$$$message_0338_0000_0009$$$::"Huh? [l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HRIN6_RIN_0090 _name=凛]No way..."::
42503::$$$message_0338_0000_0010$$$::"Look at the signature on the back of the second page. The fact that it was sent to Shirou Emiya can only mean it was the priest's doing."::
42504::$$$message_0338_0000_0011$$$::"...Ah."::
42505::$$$message_0338_0000_0012$$$::"Honestly. That's why you always..."::
42506::$$$message_0338_0000_0013$$$::"Oi, what's this now? So the lass's team was the first to get here, eh?"::
42507::$$$message_0338_0000_0014$$$::"Well, well. You're faster than I expected."::
42508::$$$message_0338_0000_0015$$$::"...Why are you both coming out of the bath?"::
42509::$$$message_0338_0000_0016$$$::"Because I told them to. Now, once I enter, its power will be used up... But before that, there is a show to enjoy."::
42510::$$$message_0338_0000_0017$$$::"Meaning?"::
42511::$$$message_0338_0000_0018$$$::"Once we've beaten you, your anguish will make that bathwater ever so slightly sweeter. I'm sure your rage will soothe these tired bones."::
42512::$$$message_0338_0000_0019$$$::"Wow. You're a real piece of work."::
42513::$$$message_0338_0000_0020$$$::"You got that right."::
42514::$$$message_0338_0000_0021$$$::"She knows what she's talking about."::
42515::$$$message_0338_0000_0022$$$::"Heh. Ah, sweet nectar.[lr]::
42516::$$$message_0338_0000_0023$$$::Now, can you defeat us now that we've raised our Luck stats, Rin?"::
42517::$$$message_0338_0000_0024$$$::"Hmph. You've made a huge mistake if you think that's enough to beat me!"::

